{"abstract":"In this paper, we present experimental algorithms for solving the dualization problem. We present the results of extensive experimentation comparing the execution time of various algorithms.","affiliations":[],"arxiv_id":"2505.09642","authors":["Mauro Mezzini","Fernando Cuartero Gomez","Jose Javier Paulet Gonzalez","Hernan Indibil de la Cruz Calvo","Vicente Pascual","Fernando L. Pelayo"],"availability":{"basis":"arxiv_public_full_text","checked_at":"2026-08-21T05:39:21+00:00","full_text_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2505.09642.pdf","license":"arxiv-distribution","page_count":10,"pdf_bytes":377293,"status":"available"},"citation_count":null,"content_digest":"163b4105fa7ec1fbae3bfb415425065b45030d7c0feafb45c38e339f672b29d0","created_at":"2026-08-21T05:39:21+00:00","doi":"","identifier_observations":[],"institutions":[],"landing_url":"","legacy_ids":[],"migration_provenance":{"source_content_digest":"45055991cef2c995326065aecc642b19becb6d351523dce4005cb00cdae92fe2","source_schema_version":"global-work-v1"},"openalex_id":"","pmcid":"","pmid":"","publication_date":"","revision":1,"schema_version":"global-work-v2","semantic_scholar_id":"","source_urls":[],"status":"active","title":"Experimental algorithms for the dualization problem","updated_at":"2026-08-21T05:39:21+00:00","venue":"arXiv","work_id":"W-A6DD871EDBC9","year":2025}
{"abstract":"This document presents endeavors to represent emotion in a computational cognitive architecture. The first part introduces research organizing with two axes of emotional affect: pleasantness and arousal. Following this basic of emotional components, the document discusses an aspect of emergent properties of emotion, showing interaction studies with human users. With these past author's studies, the document concludes that the advantage of the cognitive human-agent interaction approach is in representing human internal states and processes.","affiliations":[],"arxiv_id":"2301.00003","authors":["Junya Morita"],"availability":{"basis":"arxiv_public_full_text","checked_at":"2026-08-22T15:05:43+00:00","full_text_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2301.00003.pdf","license":"arxiv-distribution","page_count":3,"pdf_bytes":443810,"status":"available"},"citation_count":null,"content_digest":"abf0e01c1fb1b3ae9e38d6c60673223cbbf3499fa5dab144df4c5737f93aad63","created_at":"2026-08-22T15:05:43+00:00","doi":"","identifier_observations":[],"institutions":[],"landing_url":"","legacy_ids":[],"migration_provenance":{},"openalex_id":"","pmcid":"","pmid":"","publication_date":"","revision":1,"schema_version":"global-work-v2","semantic_scholar_id":"","source_urls":[],"status":"active","title":"Emotion in Cognitive Architecture: Emergent Properties from Interactions with Human Emotion","updated_at":"2026-08-22T15:05:43+00:00","venue":"arXiv","work_id":"W-FAA3FA36FE3B","year":2022}
